version: "0.2.0"
abstract: >-
  Trilingual research demonstrator for EPS technology evaluation, contextual
  recommendation, pedagogical scenario design and teaching support. The
  application uses documented and unverified real-app entries and heuristic
  matching. The Laboratory provides 32 field instruments, descriptive and
  inferential statistics checked against R (29/29 metrics) and a three-level
  restitution. This release does not establish empirical educational efficacy,
  scientific validation of the instruments or institutional production readiness.
